```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hello Fullscreen</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #111;
            color: white;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 64px;
            margin: 0 0 30px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-size: 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: white;
            color: #111;
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Hello</h1>
        <button onclick="goFullscreen()">Click for Fullscreen</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        function goFullscreen() {
            if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
                document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();
            } else {
                document.exitFullscreen();
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```
